title: The Digital State
subtitle: A ministry can build public infrastructure—or another vendor portal.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_government_card
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and ministries_finalized = 1 and digital_minister_party = "Lewica" and month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_digital_state_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_digital_state_timer = 5
card-image: img/poland/cards/advisor-gawkowski.webp

= The Digital State

The ministry has inherited a shelf of incompatible registers and a coalition
full of people who call every new login a reform. The Left can use the office
to make the state legible, but only if it decides whom the system is for.

- @public_stack
- @services_first
- @open_the_contracts

@public_stack
title: Build a common public digital stack
subtitle: Cost: 2 budget capacity. Expensive plumbing produces visible delivery later.
choose-if: budget >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: The shared registers and public hosting layer require two budget points.
on-arrival: budget -= 2; government_delivery += 5; public_trust += 3; media_capacity += 2; p2050_coalition_dissent += 3 if government_party != "pis"; government_coalition_dissent += 3 if government_party = "pis"; pis_relation -= 2 if government_party = "pis"; news_headline = "The Digital Ministry starts replacing the state's patchwork of private systems"

Procurement notices are rewritten around open standards, shared registers and
public ownership of essential code. [? if government_party != "pis": Poland
2050 approves of the word “modernisation” and objects to most of the means.?]
[? if government_party = "pis": PiS approves of the word “sovereignty” and
objects when it discovers that public ownership also means opening old
contracts to scrutiny.?]

- #poland_card_finish


@services_first
title: Join the services citizens use most
subtitle: A narrower programme can be delivered within the existing envelope.
on-arrival: government_delivery += 3; household_security += 2; public_trust += 2; p2050_relation += 2 if government_party != "pis"; pis_relation += 1 if government_party = "pis"; news_headline = "Benefits and municipal services receive one reliable digital front door"

The ministry postpones the grand architecture and joins the systems behind
benefits, appointments and local government. It is less elegant than a total
rebuild and much easier to notice.

- #poland_card_finish


@open_the_contracts
title: Publish the contracts and interoperability failures
subtitle: No resource or budget cost. Transparency substitutes for investment.
on-arrival: constitutional_restraint += 2; public_trust += 2; government_coalition_dissent += 1; news_headline = "The Digital Ministry opens the state's technology contracts to scrutiny"

Officials release vendor dependencies, service failures and renewal dates.
Nothing has yet been repaired, but future lock-in becomes harder to disguise
as technical necessity.

- #poland_card_finish
